  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the quadrilateral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;with vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to"
